Jennifer Kocher shoots a match against Memphis " src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/24/DSC00858.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University rifle team collected its second Great America Rifle Conference win of the season on Saturday, defeating Memphis 4748-4684 at the Bill McKenzie Mobile Rifle Range inside the WVU Shell Building. The win also marks the third against a ranked opponent this season.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/24/DSC00858.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/24/DSC00858.jpg"><media:title>Jennifer Kocher shoots a match against Memphis </media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/24/DSC00858.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:09:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>8</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59585</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Head to Georgia Southern</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/24/mens-soccer-mountaineers-head-to-georgia-southern</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/24/mens-soccer-mountaineers-head-to-georgia-southern</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Kanta Ishii prepares to take a free kick" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/24/MSOC_WVUvsUCF_Oct21_2026_TT_122_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 25 West Virginia University men's soccer hits the road to take on Georgia Southern in a Sun Belt matchup, Sunday, Oct. 25. Kickoff from Bo Pitts Field is set for 2 p.m.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/co